{"id":"esperanza","lemma":"esperanza","pos":"noun","rank":828,"glosses":["hope, hopefulness","expectation, expectancy"],"ipa":"/espeˈɾanθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"esperanzas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-esperanza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él había perdido toda esperanza.","en":"He had lost all hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704046","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null]},{"text":"Un nuevo año siempre trae esperanza.","en":"A new year always brings hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599056","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"new"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to bring","l":"traer"},null]},{"text":"Aún no he perdido las esperanzas.","en":"I haven't abandoned hope yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506490","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Ésta era su única esperanza.","en":"This was his one and only hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645344","words":[{"g":"this one","l":"éste"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"only","l":"único"},null]},{"text":"Nunca perdí las esperanzas.","en":"I never lost hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611638","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}